	(text "Pmod 100BASE-TX PHY front end, MagJack (HR911105A) variant - see ../README.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6d82ebb2-af63-51a6-8630-f719e72735a4")
	)
	(text "Pmod J1: plugs into Tang Primer 25K pmod0 (3.3 V bank). 1-4 top row = P, 7-10 bottom row = N.\nA: 1/7 (F5/G5)  B: 2/8 (G7/G8)  PWM_A/B: 3/9 (H8/H7)  TX_P/N: 4/10 (H5/J5)  - verify by ball name."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5efd5fee-62bf-5d98-a6a0-4c27fadc2119")
	)
	(text "TX: LVCMOS33 x2 -> Rs 62R / Rp 120R (Thevenin 2V/50R each side) -> Cr 47pF -> C3/C4 0.1uF DC block\n-> transformer primary (J2 1/2). The DC block is REQUIRED: +/- states put DC across the winding."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fb6b0d3a-fc48-5782-b4b2-f5c1c27e1316")
	)
	(text "RX: J2 3/6 (transformer secondary) -> 2x49.9R termination, midpoint Ct to GND.\nTap caps Ca 0.1uF make 4 DC-isolated comparator inputs.\nA = (v > VTH_A-VB), B = (v > -(VTH_B-VB)), c = A^B = NRZI."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3431f240-bf99-5988-b192-8e0b99204fc9")
	)
	(text "Bias: VB = 1.32 V. VTH = VB + (D*3.3-VB)*1k/4.3k  (-0.31 .. +0.46 V vs VB)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b45cdf25-8b88-5f2c-9428-4111d0d26f50")
	)
	(text "U1: ESD array on the PHY side of the magnetics (flow-through, NC pads carry the line).\nTCT/RCT: AC ground only (C17/C18). Do NOT tie to 3.3 V (voltage-mode driver).\nJ2 pin 8 = integrated Bob Smith 1nF/2kV return -> GND. LEDs (9-12) unused.\nPoE: no PSE behind this board; isolation by magnetics."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "824ce204-c9f2-5be8-bee6-126de0f837e3")
	)
	(text "3.3 V decoupling at J1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c95790f-80a2-5d9a-825a-221d672c500f")
	)
